      "kind": "planning decision",
      "description": "The M-1 property held a vacant building formerly used as a foundry, with a 50-foot rear yard on Galvez Avenue. The City Planning Commission approved, with conditions and by a 4-1 vote, automobile dismantling inside the existing enclosed building.",
