    {
      "date": "1978-02-16",
      "kind": "planning decision",
      "description": "The City Planning Commission authorized, 4-2 and with conditions, an auto wrecking yard on the corner lot, relocated in part from Quint Street and Evans Avenue to make way for the City's wastewater construction, over the opposition of the Bayview-Hunters Point Community Coordinating Council (Resolution 7894).",
